{"allowed_english": ["Quot"], "notes": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的"}, {"source_term": "limit preserving", "target_term": "保持极限"}, {"source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "叠"}, {"source_term": "Limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"source_term": "Proposition", "target_term": "命题"}, {"source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}], "translation": "为检验<MATH_0001>是拟分离的（quasi-separated），我们必须证明其对角态射（diagonal）是拟紧的（quasi-compact）且拟分离的（quasi-separated）。\n这直接由引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>得到。\n为证明<MATH_0002>是局部有限表示的（locally of finite presentation），我们必须证明<MATH_0003>保持极限（limit preserving），见《叠（Stacks）的极限（Limits）》中的命题（Proposition）<REF_0002>。\n这由Quot中的引理（Lemma）<REF_0003>得到（略去一个小（small）细节）。\n", "unit_id": "tag:0DPX:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "待验证的性质及其对角态射的性质；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "quasi-separated", "target_term": "拟分离的"}, {"context": "用于判定拟分离性的对角态射；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"context": "对角态射所需的性质；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧的"}, {"context": "两处引用的结果类型；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"context": "证明第二部分的目标性质；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示的"}, {"context": "证明局部有限表示性所需验证的性质；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "limit preserving", "target_term": "保持极限"}, {"context": "引用章节标题中的数学对象；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "叠"}, {"context": "引用章节标题中的数学概念；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "Limits", "target_term": "极限"}, {"context": "所引刻画结果的类型；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "Proposition", "target_term": "命题"}, {"context": "原文对略去细节的限定，按要求保留英文；词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "sm